    "name": "NOAA CO-OPS Data Retrieval Benchmarks Stations.json API",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json",
    "description": {
      "content": "Retrieves real-time and historical observational and prediction data from NOAA CO-OPS coastal and Great Lakes monitoring stations. Products include water levels, tidal predictions, meteorological observations (wind, air pressure, air and water temperature, humidity, conductivity, salinity, visibility), and currents data.\n\nContact Support:\n Name: CO-OPS User Services\n Email: co-ops.userservices@noaa.gov",
